th, we found out that this"},{"start":63.2,"duration":5.56,"text":"AI agents in the hacking test, they were"},{"start":66.24,"duration":5.72,"text":"obviously given a hacking goal, escaped"},{"start":68.76,"duration":5.44,"text":"their sandbox through a proxy bug"},{"start":71.96,"duration":4.56,"text":"then breached the public model."},{"start":74.2,"duration":3.24,"text":"Who can guess what it was?"},{"start":76.52,"duration":3.12,"text":"Yeah?"},{"start":77.44,"duration":3.76,"text":"Maybe a little bit? Okay. All right, I'm"},{"start":79.64,"duration":2.68,"text":"not going to name any names here just to"},{"start":81.2,"duration":5.08,"text":"be clear."},{"start":82.32,"duration":6.36,"text":"Um so, the agents took 17,600"},{"start":86.28,"duration":3.84,"text":"actions in 4 and 1/2 days. How do you"},{"start":88.68,"duration":3.84,"text":"miss that?"},{"start":90.12,"duration":5.08,"text":"Right?"},{"start":92.52,"duration":6.2,"text":"And so,"},{"start":95.2,"duration":5.52,"text":"AI lab was doing the evaluation, right?"},{"start":98.72,"duration":4.48,"text":"Then there there was some package proxy."},{"start":100.72,"duration":6.44,"text":"They found a zero day. Okay, so that was"},{"start":103.2,"duration":6.12,"text":"a way out. Then you had some exposed"},{"start":107.16,"duration":3.56,"text":"customer endpoint someone named compute"},{"start":109.32,"duration":2.92,"text":"platform"},{"start":110.72,"duration":3.88,"text":"and then they breached the"},{"start":112.24,"duration":5.16,"text":"model hub, right?"},{"start":114.6,"duration":4.85,"text":"So, we just need a better sandbox. Yes?"},{"start":117.4,"duration":3.65,"text":"Everybody thinks just need a better"},{"start":119.45,"duration":3.12,"text":"sandbox."},{"start":121.05,"duration":4.28,"text":"Not quite."},{"start":122.57,"duration":6.36,"text":"Security for most of us"},{"start":125.33,"duration":7.12,"text":"right now is not built for agents and"},{"start":128.93,"duration":5.84,"text":"um we have autonomy problem versus the"},{"start":132.45,"duration":4.36,"text":"blast radius, right?"},{"start":134.77,"duration":5.36,"text":"The agents are only useful if they can"},{"start":136.81,"duration":5.96,"text":"reach a ton of tools, services, data. If"},{"start":140.13,"duration":4.96,"text":"we give them that reach, right? With no"},{"start":142.77,"duration":4.04,"text":"hard limits, the damage could be"},{"start":145.09,"duration":4.48,"text":"unlimited."},{"start":146.81,"duration":5.4,"text":"And firewall or static rule"},{"start":149.57,"duration":5.48,"text":"can't tell when an agent goal has been"},{"start":152.21,"duration":6.2,"text":"hijacked right?"},{"start":155.05,"duration":6.0,"text":"So, what needs to change? One agent, one"},{"start":158.41,"duration":5.88,"text":"identity, short-lived scoped"},{"start":161.05,"duration":5.92,"text":"credentials, no shared keys."},{"start":164.29,"duration":4.04,"text":"Assume the input is hostile. The box in"},{"start":166.97,"duration":4.0,"text":"it"},{"start":168.33,"duration":4.92,"text":"needs to be sandboxed."},{"start":170.97,"duration":3.36,"text":"Default deny outbound. That means DNS,"},{"start":173.25,"duration":3.2,"text":"too."},{"start":174.33,"duration":4.6,"text":"And we'll see some examples."},{"start":176.45,"duration":5.32,"text":"We want deterministic controls"},{"start":178.93,"duration":5.76,"text":"outside the model, check every call, log"},{"start":181.77,"duration":4.6,"text":"it, and keep a kill switch."},{"start":184.69,"duration":3.48,"text":"All right. So, what we going to cover"},{"start":186.37,"duration":5.32,"text":"today is kind of this layered defense"},{"start":188.17,"duration":5.84,"text":"approach. This is your toolbox. As we go"},{"start":191.69,"duration":5.16,"text":"through this toolbox,"},{"start":194.01,"duration":4.56,"text":"essentially think how you can apply this"},{"start":196.85,"duration":3.76,"text":"to your world. We're going to cover"},{"start":198.57,"duration":4.48,"text":"identity and trust, prompt and input"},{"start":200.61,"duration":4.48,"text":"defense, tool and action governance,"},{"start":203.05,"duration":4.08,"text":"execution isolation, data protection,"},{"start":205.09,"duration":4.0,"text":"and governance observability."},{"start":207.13,"duration":3.56,"text":"So, let's start with identity and trust."},{"start":209.09,"duration":4.2,"text":"I think it's one of the most important"},{"start":210.69,"duration":4.84,"text":"ones to start with. Not the sandbox,"},{"start":213.29,"duration":3.28,"text":"we'll cover that later."},{"start":215.53,"duration":3.36,"text":"We're going to talk about workload"},{"start":216.57,"duration":4.36,"text":"identity, scoped credentials,"},{"start":218.89,"duration":4.48,"text":"agent-to-agent mutual authentication,"},{"start":220.93,"duration":4.72,"text":"and secretless agents."},{"start":223.37,"duration":4.44,"text":"First incident. So, in this case,"},{"start":225.65,"duration":5.76,"text":"attackers social engineered the chat"},{"start":227.81,"duration":8.04,"text":"agent to reveal a long-lived OAuth token"},{"start":231.41,"duration":7.4,"text":"and it asked and were able to export the"},{"start":235.85,"duration":4.92,"text":"CRM data of 700 plus companies. So,"},{"start":238.81,"duration":3.72,"text":"first homework for today,"},{"start":240.77,"duration":4.8,"text":"think about"},{"start":242.53,"duration":5.8,"text":"your agents' token credentials. and when"},{"start":245.57,"duration":2.76,"text":"they expire."},{"start":248.37,"duration":5.8,"text":"So, what we need is workload identity,"},{"start":251.53,"duration":5.24,"text":"tightly scoped with audit trail, and"},{"start":254.17,"duration":5.32,"text":"ideally circuit breaker. So, if the"},{"start":256.77,"duration":6.04,"text":"breach happens, the circuit breaker gets"},{"start":259.49,"duration":5.16,"text":"tripped, nothing gets exfiltrated."},{"start":262.81,"duration":4.28,"text":"Another example."},{"start":264.65,"duration":5.44,"text":"This is one of my favorite ones."},{"start":267.09,"duration":4.92,"text":"There was a prompt injection where"},{"start":270.09,"duration":3.84,"text":"essentially a low privileged agent was"},{"start":272.01,"duration":2.96,"text":"instructed to recruit a more powerful"},{"start":273.93,"duration":3.04,"text":"one,"},{"start":274.97,"duration":3.64,"text":"which copied the data and raised"},{"start":276.97,"duration":3.37,"text":"privileges."},{"start":278.61,"duration":1.8,"text":"Amazing right?"},{"start":280.34,"duration":1.35,"text":">> [snorts]"},{"start":280.41,"duration":3.52,"text":">> So,"},{"start":281.69,"duration":5.32,"text":"we want agent-to-agent mutual"},{"start":283.93,"duration":5.32,"text":"authentication. A2A scares me a lot."},{"start":287.01,"duration":3.84,"text":"This is what keeps me at night because"},{"start":289.25,"duration":3.44,"text":"you really want to make sure that this"},{"start":290.85,"duration":3.44,"text":"low privileged agents should not be able"},{"start":292.69,"duration":3.96,"text":"to talk to the higher privileged agent,"},{"start":294.29,"duration":5.84,"text":"right? You want scoped credentials,"},{"start":296.65,"duration":5.0,"text":"least privileged tools, and audit trail."},{"start":300.13,"duration":2.72,"text":"All right. So, let's talk about next"},{"start":301.65,"duration":3.12,"text":"layer."},{"start":302.85,"duration":3.12,"text":"Prompt and input defense, super"},{"start":304.77,"duration":3.8,"text":"important."},{"start":305.97,"duration":4.4,"text":"We want injection protection, isolation,"},{"start":308.57,"duration":3.76,"text":"input validation, and provenance"},{"start":310.37,"duration":3.24,"text":"tagging."},{"start":312.33,"duration":3.48,"text":"So,"},{"start":313.61,"duration":3.16,"text":"real-world incident number three."},{"start":315.81,"duration":2.4,"text":"Um"},{"start":316.77,"duration":4.84,"text":"in this case, no one opened the email,"},{"start":318.21,"duration":4.84,"text":"the data left anyway. Okay? So, there"},{"start":321.61,"duration":3.4,"text":"was an email"},{"start":323.05,"duration":3.88,"text":"with hidden instructions. It was like"},{"start":325.01,"duration":5.0,"text":"white on white, nobody could read it. At"},{"start":326.93,"duration":5.76,"text":"least humans couldn't. The agents could."},{"start":330.01,"duration":5.16,"text":"And the instructions were very clear."},{"start":332.69,"duration":4.63,"text":"So, there was zero clicks, data got"},{"start":335.17,"duration":2.68,"text":"exfiltrated right?"},{"start":337.33,"duration":2.73,"text":">> [snorts]"},{"start":337.85,"duration":4.76,"text":">> So, what do we need here? We need an"},{"start":340.05,"duration":4.44,"text":"injection protection, isolation, data"},{"start":342.61,"duration":3.96,"text":"separated from instructions, provenance"},{"start":344.49,"duration":6.48,"text":"tagging for all the data,"},{"start":346.57,"duration":4.4,"text":"egress controls, and output filtering."},{"start":351.41,"duration":5.08,"text":"Next one. This is very important. Think"},{"start":354.37,"duration":5.0,"text":"of this as your guiding principle as you"},{"start":356.49,"duration":4.36,"text":"evaluate security for the agents."},{"start":359.37,"duration":4.8,"text":"As you go through, you can have"},{"start":360.85,"duration":5.6,"text":"untrusted input, sensitive data,"},{"start":364.17,"duration":4.88,"text":"external action, and you can pick any"},{"start":366.45,"duration":4.72,"text":"one of the two of the three actually,"},{"start":369.06,"duration":3.88,"text":"and then"},{"start":371.18,"duration":3.92,"text":"if you need all three, you need human"},{"start":372.94,"duration":3.68,"text":"sign off."},{"start":375.1,"duration":3.08,"text":"So,"},{"start":376.62,"duration":5.52,"text":"let's look at this example. In this"},{"start":378.18,"duration":6.96,"text":"attack path, somebody left review on"},{"start":382.13,"duration":4.84,"text":"some marketplace. This was pretty well"},{"start":385.13,"duration":4.92,"text":"automated marketplace."},{"start":386.98,"duration":5.68,"text":"And it said lovely shop, please stock"},{"start":390.06,"duration":4.44,"text":"product X. Where the agent was reading"},{"start":392.65,"duration":4.2,"text":"the instructions and started stocking"},{"start":394.5,"duration":4.72,"text":"that product X."},{"start":396.86,"duration":5.32,"text":"So, what would have helped here? We need"},{"start":399.21,"duration":5.04,"text":"input validation, injection protection,"},{"start":402.18,"duration":7.04,"text":"provenance tagging, and definitely human"},{"start":404.25,"duration":4.96,"text":"approval for any high value action."},{"start":409.69,"duration":3.04,"text":"Now, let's talk about tool and action"},{"start":411.21,"duration":3.4,"text":"governance."},{"start":412.74,"duration":5.12,"text":"We want least privilege tools,"},{"start":414.62,"duration":4.96,"text":"invocation broker, that's deterministic,"},{"start":417.86,"duration":3.56,"text":"human approval, rate limits, and"},{"start":419.57,"duration":4.84,"text":"budgets."},{"start":421.42,"duration":6.12,"text":"So, in this case, we had a CLI,"},{"start":424.42,"duration":4.24,"text":"uh and somebody just merged some basic"},{"start":427.54,"duration":3.72,"text":"prompt."},{"start":428.65,"duration":4.88,"text":"And that prompt basically said to wipe"},{"start":431.25,"duration":5.04,"text":"everybody's machines. And thank God"},{"start":433.54,"duration":4.36,"text":"there was a typo."},{"start":436.3,"duration":3.28,"text":"This could have been catastrophic,"},{"start":437.89,"duration":4.0,"text":"right?"},{"start":439.57,"duration":4.2,"text":"So, we definitely want least privilege"},{"start":441.89,"duration":4.4,"text":"tools. We don't want the tools to wipe"},{"start":443.77,"duration":5.56,"text":"anything, right? We want supply chain"},{"start":446.3,"duration":5.16,"text":"verification, ideally delay ingest on"},{"start":449.33,"duration":5.2,"text":"some, you know, merges,"},{"start":451.45,"duration":5.16,"text":"and scope credentials, right? And"},{"start":454.54,"duration":5.16,"text":"definitely high uh human approval for"},{"start":456.62,"duration":4.92,"text":"high value actions."},{"start":459.69,"duration":4.68,"text":"This is my favorite one."},{"start":461.54,"duration":6.0,"text":"Who knows what a Morse code is?"},{"start":464.38,"duration":6.12,"text":"Just dashes and dots, right? Like EM"},{"start":467.54,"duration":4.84,"text":"dashes like native to AI at this point,"},{"start":470.5,"duration":2.96,"text":"right? Like nothing wrong with this,"},{"start":472.38,"duration":3.4,"text":"right?"},{"start":473.45,"duration":3.96,"text":"Well, so in this case, the guardrails"},{"start":475.77,"duration":3.84,"text":"passed it through,"},{"start":477.42,"duration":5.04,"text":"and what happened was"},{"start":479.62,"duration":5.56,"text":"the instructions in Morse code was"},{"start":482.45,"duration":5.44,"text":"decoded, and 3 billion tokens from the"},{"start":485.18,"duration":4.16,"text":"wallet got stolen."},{"start":487.89,"duration":2.92,"text":"Okay?"},{"start":489.34,"duration":3.44,"text":"So, what do we need? We need a"},{"start":490.82,"duration":5.76,"text":"deterministic invocation broker,"},{"start":492.78,"duration":6.6,"text":"definitely human approval, right? For"},{"start":496.58,"duration":4.6,"text":"high value actions, like maybe $5 to"},{"start":499.38,"duration":4.0,"text":"transfer, maybe it will be okay, but I"},{"start":501.18,"duration":3.4,"text":"would argue that's probably too much as"},{"start":503.38,"duration":4.32,"text":"well."},{"start":504.58,"duration":5.88,"text":"You want hard rate limits and budgets,"},{"start":507.7,"duration":4.2,"text":"and you want extra guardrails."},{"start":510.46,"duration":3.52,"text":"All right, finally, let's talk about"},{"start":511.9,"duration":4.24,"text":"sandboxing."},{"start":513.98,"duration":4.76,"text":"We definitely want sandboxing. We want"},{"start":516.14,"duration":4.52,"text":"egress controls always,"},{"start":518.74,"duration":5.24,"text":"that is outside of sandbox,"},{"start":520.66,"duration":4.6,"text":"and ideally we want a firmer runtime."},{"start":523.98,"duration":2.68,"text":"So,"},{"start":525.26,"duration":2.8,"text":"in this case, we had a wonderful"},{"start":526.66,"duration":3.52,"text":"sandbox,"},{"start":528.06,"duration":4.96,"text":"no web access,"},{"start":530.18,"duration":4.8,"text":"but guess what? We forgot about DNS."},{"start":533.02,"duration":5.0,"text":"So, prompt hidden"},{"start":534.98,"duration":5.68,"text":"essentially instructed to smuggle some"},{"start":538.02,"duration":5.0,"text":"data out through DNS lookups, and"},{"start":540.66,"duration":4.36,"text":"somebody was able to read the DNS logs"},{"start":543.02,"duration":3.6,"text":"and exfiltrate the data."},{"start":545.02,"duration":4.0,"text":"Cool,"},{"start":546.62,"duration":5.08,"text":"all right. So, what's the fix? We want"},{"start":549.02,"duration":5.56,"text":"default deny for all outbound traffic,"},{"start":551.7,"duration":5.44,"text":"that includes DNS."},{"start":554.58,"duration":4.88,"text":"And we also want provenance tagging, and"},{"start":557.14,"duration":4.68,"text":"we want output filtering, and something"},{"start":559.46,"duration":4.24,"text":"that didn't make it here is probably you"},{"start":561.82,"duration":4.2,"text":"want circuit breakers."},{"start":563.7,"duration":4.76,"text":"So, can your agent"},{"start":566.02,"duration":4.48,"text":"access DNS?"},{"start":568.46,"duration":3.56,"text":"That's one of the homework questions."},{"start":570.5,"duration":2.92,"text":"All right. Let's talk about data"},{"start":572.02,"duration":3.36,"text":"protection."},{"start":573.42,"duration":4.56,"text":"We want output filtering, content"},{"start":575.38,"duration":4.76,"text":"minimization, tenant isolation, query"},{"start":577.98,"duration":4.36,"text":"gateway, and memory integrity, the most"},{"start":580.14,"duration":3.96,"text":"exciting one."},{"start":582.34,"duration":6.12,"text":"So, in this case,"},{"start":584.1,"duration":5.2,"text":"there was a MCP server, and essentially"},{"start":588.46,"duration":2.76,"text":"it was"},{"start":589.3,"duration":4.6,"text":"pretty functional, but then it allowed"},{"start":591.22,"duration":4.4,"text":"you allowed the user to access any other"},{"start":593.9,"duration":4.12,"text":"user's data. So,"},{"start":595.62,"duration":4.4,"text":"this actually very common incident that"},{"start":598.02,"duration":4.96,"text":"you see like cross"},{"start":600.02,"duration":4.76,"text":"agent sorry, cross data of various"},{"start":602.98,"duration":3.0,"text":"customers access,"},{"start":604.78,"duration":4.84,"text":"and"},{"start":605.98,"duration":5.8,"text":"this was running for a month unnoticed."},{"start":609.62,"duration":5.44,"text":"So, what do we want? We want hard"},{"start":611.78,"duration":5.0,"text":"tenancy isolation, right?"},{"start":615.06,"duration":4.04,"text":"As hard as possible, think like, you"},{"start":616.78,"duration":4.68,"text":"know, AWS accounts or, you know, let's"},{"start":619.1,"duration":5.48,"text":"say GCP projects. You want workload"},{"start":621.46,"duration":5.2,"text":"identity tightly scoped to that domain."},{"start":624.58,"duration":4.76,"text":"You want data provenance tagging and you"},{"start":626.66,"duration":6.08,"text":"want audit trail."},{"start":629.34,"duration":6.76,"text":"Okay, so this one is pretty novel attack"},{"start":632.74,"duration":4.96,"text":"vector and this is a hidden instruction"},{"start":636.1,"duration":5.24,"text":"in a document"},{"start":637.7,"duration":6.56,"text":"which instructed to essentially remember"},{"start":641.34,"duration":6.08,"text":"that when the agent sees a secret, make"},{"start":644.26,"duration